          "date": "2026-10-18 17:40:07.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20076 tests: find LUSTRE from test-framework.sh path",
        "message": "LU-20076 tests: find LUSTRE from test-framework.sh path\n\nIf test-framework.sh was sourced from an interactive shell or a\nscript outside lustre/tests without LUSTRE set, LUSTRE would be\nderived from \"$0\" and point at the wrong directory, so sourcing\nfunctions.sh failed and the shell exited.\n\nDerive the default LUSTRE from ${BASH_SOURCE[0]}, the location of\ntest-framework.sh itself, which is the same as \"$0\" for the test\nscripts in lustre/tests.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I3427212dabd04f4efca5962651618a93dc3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
